```

### RESULT

Students understand concrete matrix computations and how to solve linear systems. The `solve()` function is related to normal equations in linear regression.

### THEORY

Linear algebra (matrix inversion and eigen-decomposition) underpins PCA, linear models, and many optimization problems. Conditioning and invertibility are important.
